    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The last step follows from the chain rule for differentiation. $$ \\frac{d\\ln f(x)}{dx}=\\frac{1}{f(x)}\\frac{df(x)}{dx} $$",
      "source_page": 116,
      "source_pages": [
        116
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
